[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To set up the systemplate, run as root:

%%LOCALBASE%%/bin/coolwsd-systemplate-setup %%LOCALBASE%%/share/collabora/systemplate %%LOCALBASE%%/share/collabora-office-online/instdir/

Important: %%LOCALBASE%%/share/collabora/systemplate must be owned by
collaboraonline:collaboraonline, but not recursively.  After the systemplate is
created, run:

chown collaboraonline:collaboraonline %%LOCALBASE%%/share/collabora/systemplate

See https://sdk.collaboraonline.com/docs/installation/Proxy_settings.html#reverse-proxy-settings-in-nginx-config-ssl-termination
for an nginx config that fits the default config with ssl-termination true and
ssl-enabled false.
EOM
}
]
